  "dcterms:title": "Chemical and Product Categories (CPCat)",
  "dcterms:description": "CPCat maps more than 43,000 chemicals to a set of ~800 harmonized terms categorizing their use or function. It is compiled and released by the U.S. EPA as part of the CompTox Chemicals Dashboard / DSSTox project. The brick downloads CPCat.zip directly from EPA's public gaftp server (gaftp.epa.gov/COMPTOX/Sustainable_Chemistry_Data/Chemistry_Dashboard/CPCat.zip). Per the CompTox Dashboard, the aggregated chemistry content is distributed as public-domain U.S. Government data.",
